# Blou SEO agent playbook

Use this when creating or updating organic pages for tryblou.com. Follow every checklist item; missing one step causes sitemap or internal-link drift.

Canonical helpers live in:
- [`src/lib/seo.ts`](src/lib/seo.ts) — `buildMetadata`, Article/FAQ/HowTo/Speakable JSON-LD
- [`src/lib/staticRoutes.ts`](src/lib/staticRoutes.ts) — sitemap registry for static pages
- [`src/lib/blouGuides.ts`](src/lib/blouGuides.ts) — data-driven guides
- [`src/lib/relatedPillarSlugs.ts`](src/lib/relatedPillarSlugs.ts) — pillar cluster slugs
- [`src/components/marketing/RelatedGuides.tsx`](src/components/marketing/RelatedGuides.tsx) — `RELATED_LINK_MAP` titles/hrefs
- [`src/lib/countryHreflang.ts`](src/lib/countryHreflang.ts) — unique calculator hreflang tags
- [`src/components/marketing/SpeakableJsonLd.tsx`](src/components/marketing/SpeakableJsonLd.tsx) — Speakable JSON-LD for `#quick-answer`

Also follow the installed skill at [`.agents/skills/seo/SKILL.md`](.agents/skills/seo/SKILL.md) (web-quality-skills).

## New pillar page checklist (all required)

1. Create `src/app/<slug>/page.tsx` using the standard template:
   - `buildMetadata({ title, description, path, type: "article", publishedTime, modifiedTime, keywords })`
   - Single `<h1>`, `Breadcrumbs`, `Byline`, `TableOfContents`
   - `<section id="quick-answer">` + `QuickAnswerBox` + `SpeakableJsonLd`
   - `FaqSection`, `RelatedGuides`, `buildArticleJsonLd` (and HowTo when steps exist)
   - App Store CTA via existing marketing components
2. Register in `src/lib/staticRoutes.ts` with an accurate `lastModified` (content change date only — never bump on every deploy).
3. Add the slug to `RELATED_PILLAR_SLUGS` and a matching `RELATED_LINK_MAP` entry.
4. Add at least one internal link from the homepage hub and/or a sibling pillar page (descriptive anchor text).

Do **not** add `/privacy` or `/terms` to the sitemap; those pages are `noindex`.

## New guide checklist (all required)

1. Add an entry to `src/lib/blouGuides.ts` with:
   - `targetKeyword`, `quickAnswer`, `quickFacts` (3 facts), `faq`, `datePublished`, `dateModified`
   - Optional: `medicalConditionName`, `dateReviewed`, `relatedSlugs`
2. While drafting, set `published: false` so the guide is excluded from the sitemap, `/guides` index, `RelatedGuides`, and `generateStaticParams`.
3. When ready, remove `published: false` (or set `true`). Per-guide OG auto-generates via `src/app/guides/[slug]/opengraph-image.tsx`.

## Country calculator notes

- Never set two countries to the same hreflang string.
- Always derive tags via `countryHreflang(slug, locale)` / `calculatorLanguageAlternates()` — do not store a hand-edited `hreflang` field.
- Sitemap and page `<head>` alternates must use the same helper.

## Post-publish checklist

1. Run `npm run seo:check` (must pass; title-length notes are warnings).
2. Run `npm run build` (must succeed).
3. Spot-check structured data in [Google Rich Results Test](https://search.google.com/test/rich-results).
4. Confirm the URL appears in `https://tryblou.com/sitemap.xml` (unless `noindex`).

## Title / description guidelines

- Titles: primary keyword near the start; aim ≤50–60 characters before the `| Blou` template suffix.
- Meta descriptions: unique, 150–160 characters, include a clear CTA when natural.
- One `<h1>` per page; do not skip heading levels.
